  "gameDescriptionHtml": "\n<b>GET A TASTE OF PRISON LIFE!</b><br>\nExperience life in prison in the comfort of your own home. Without any real-life consequences!<p></p>\n<p><b>BE A COOL GUY OR A TOTAL JERK!</b><br>\nAs a prison guard, your job is to maintain order behind the prison walls. But on the other hand – you’re in charge here. So who the hell is gonna tell you what to do? Are you gonna be the role model CO or a total a-hole? It’s up to you, dude.</p>\n<p><b>SIMULATE CORRECTIONAL OFFICER’S WORK!</b><br>\nSimulate the hell of a prisons guard’s life. Look for contraband (you don’t want to know where…), gun maintenance, or shoot some hoops during your break. Not enough? My dude, there’s so much more!</p>\n<p><b>ADVANCED PRISONER CREATOR!</b><br>\nCheck out our reeeeeally cool prisoner creator. But guys, please – no celebrities or politicians, okay?</p>\n<p><b>PRISON STORY!</b><br>\nExperience the thrilling prison story (missing your fav prison TV shows? We’ve got you covered)</p>\n<p><b>FUN TO PLAY, FUN TO WATCH!</b><br>\nThis game is really fun for streaming on Twitch/Youtube. Srsly – give it a go if you’re into that kind of thing.</p>\n",
